<translation id="6291549208091401781">Tayari Decentr imesakinishwa kwa watumiaji wote kwenye kompyuta yako.</translation>
<translation id="6368958679917195344">Decentr OS imewezeshwa na programu ya ziada ya <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />programu huria<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />.</translation>
